{
  "key": 63855,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_WakeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\n",
        "I don’t get challenged very often!\r",
        "The glory you are now beholding is\n",
        "the Pastoria Gym Leader!\r",
        "That’s right, I’m Crasher Wake!\r",
        "My Pokémon were toughened up by\n",
        "stormy white waters!\r",
        "They’ll take everything you can throw\n",
        "at them and then pull you under!\r",
        "Victory will be ours!\n",
        "Come on, let’s get it done!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_BeatWake",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems the undertow pulled me\n",
        "under...\r",
        "But I had a great time battling\n",
        "with you!\r",
        "You’ve earned this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_WakeReveiveFenBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Fen Badge from Wake!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_WakeExplainFenBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "You need that Fen Badge to use the\n",
        "hidden move Surf outside of battle.\r",
        "This is a special reward from me in\n",
        "recognition of your team’s power.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_WakeExplainTM55",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contains the\n",
        "move {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "It inflicts double the damage on\n",
        "targets with less than half their\f",
        "HP left.\r",
        "Use it to end battles decisively!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_WakeAfterbadge",
      "en_US": [
        "The styles of battling and winning\n",
        "are as widely varied as Trainers are.\r",
        "Do you want to know how I battle?\n",
        "I battle so I can say I had fun at\f",
        "the end, whether I win or lose!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_GymGuideBeforebadge",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gym Leader Wake... Uh, I mean\n",
        "Crasher Wake, is a master of\f",
        "Water-type Pokémon.\r",
        "I’d say you’ve got guts if you try\n",
        "to face down Water types with Fire-\f",
        "or Ground-type Pokémon!\r",
        "But that part I’ll leave up to you!\n",
        "Go and have some good battles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_GymGuideAfterbadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve beaten the Gym Leader!\r",
        "So, how was it?\r",
        "Did you enjoy your battle against\n",
        "Wake... I mean Crasher Wake?\r",
        "Sure, winning is important, but\n",
        "don’t forget to have fun, too!\r",
        "I think Wake... I mean Crasher Wake,\n",
        "showed you what I mean by fun."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_GymStatueBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Pastoria City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Crasher Wake\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaGym_Text_GymStatueAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Pastoria City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Crasher Wake\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: What’s there to do for Trainers\n",
        "here?\r",
        "Seems to me there’s nothing to do but\n",
        "battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: Battles that end with both sides\n",
        "enjoying the experience without caring\f",
        "about the winner or loser...\r",
        "That’s what I strive for.\r",
        "One of these days, I hope to battle\n",
        "everyone in the world..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_12",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: For all the training I do, there\n",
        "are still plenty tougher than me.\r",
        "The stronger I get, the farther away\n",
        "the goal seems to be.\r",
        "The road is harsh and long.\n",
        "There’s no end to it.\r",
        "But beside me always are my Pokémon.\n",
        "Every inch of the way!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_13",
      "en_US": "{COLOR 2}The level cap is now set to 53.{COLOR 0}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_14",
      "en_US": "Talk to the other Abra !"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_15",
      "en_US": "Go to the gym leader?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_16",
      "en_US": "You can now teleport to the gym leader!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_17",
      "en_US": "Go back at the entrance?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_18",
      "en_US": [
        "Happiny would like to heal your\n",
        "Pokémons, let her do it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaCityGym_Text_19",
      "en_US": "HAPPINY: HAP-HAP-HAPPIII!"
    }
  ]
}
